{!Contact.FirstName},<br /><br />

Thank you for your interest in the doctoral program in applied mathematics offered by the School of Mathematical and Statistical Sciences at Arizona State University.<br /><br />

Please review the <a href="http://math.asu.edu/degree-programs/phd-applied-mathematics-0">program description</a> for admission and degree requirements and for more details on <a href="http://math.asu.edu/degree-programs/how-apply">how to apply</a>. If you have any questions regarding the degree program after reviewing the information above, please contact any of the faculty advisors for applied math:<br /><br />

<a href="mailto:steven.baer@asu.edu?Subject=Applied%20 Math%20Request%20For%20Information"target="_top">Steven Baer</a><br />
